# Optional G1 profile (default collector) if ZGC feels worse on your JDK build.
# Prefer ≤3G; NEVER 4G on 8GB Mac. Matches m3-8gb.vmoptions heap ceiling.

-Xms1536M
-Xmx2560M
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=50
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+DisableExplicitGC
-XX:+PerfDisableSharedMem
-Djava.awt.headless=true
